data.text:
Buttons are fully visible, no overlay. So why did Playwright click time out? 

Possibilities:
1. The IAB backend's click implementation has an issue with these specific buttons? 
2. The page keeps re-rendering (element not "stable")? Playwright waits for element to be stable (not animiating). `transition` CSS classes on buttons — transitions on hover only, element itself static. React StrictMode double-render? Stability check requires two consecutive animation frames with same bounding box — React re-renders shouldn't move it.

Hmm wait — maybe the issue is different: `detail` state changes → re-render → the BUTTON ELEMENT gets replaced (React reconciliation keeps same DOM node normally).

